# Repo-root build context for all three Dockerfiles (apps/web, services/api,
# services/media — see infra/docker-compose.yml `context: ..`). Keeps secrets
# and host junk OUT of every image layer: without this, `COPY . .` bakes the
# populated root .env (JWT/LiveKit/S3/TURN secrets), .git history and
# host-platform node_modules into builder AND runtime stages.
.git
node_modules
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/dist
**/.turbo
**/.expo
coverage
.env
.env.*
